          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">You may spend one action to create a Phantasm and command it to attack<br>a creature. </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The target hit by the Phantasm suffers </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">HR + 12</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">damage. &nbsp;The </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">range </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">of the attack is determined by your current weapon. </span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">On any subsequent turn, you can perform an action and another<br>Magic Check to command the Phantasm to attack again, with no MP<br>requirements. Damage dealt by this spell ignores Resistances</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">This damage increases to 16 if you are level 20 or higher, or to 18 if you are<br>level 40 or higher.</span></p>",
