      "origin": "Amourn",
      "passive_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">You can now have up to </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">4 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">active Phantasms, but one of them must<br>necessarily be </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Numen</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">. Also, you cannot have more than one Numen<br>Phantasm active at a time. </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">This Phantasm cannot be used in any of the Illusionist's Skills or Spells.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><br>Numen is bound by the same set of special rules as any other Phantasm,<br>with the following exceptions</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Numen Phantasms cost 50 MP to cast.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Numen's Phantasmal Vitality equals [35]</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Once active, </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Numen has its own turn and a single action</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">. It does not<br>benefit from Spells that grant additional actions. </span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Numen’s turn can be taken either before or after the </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Illusionist’s </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">turn</span></li>\n</ul>",
          "passive_name": "CREATE PHANTASM: NUMEN",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "heroic_skill"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">If you are away from prying eyes, you may use the </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Skill </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">action and spend 1 Fabula<br>Point to disguise yourself as another creature of humanoid size and shape.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">If the creature is someone you had a chance to meet, observe or research, you may also<br>adopt their voice and mannerisms.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><br>Your disguise will reliably fool any </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">soldier</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">-rank creature, but </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">elite</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">- and </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">champion</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">rank creatures might see through it due to a failed Check or </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">opportunity</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">. </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">If a </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Villain </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">is present on the scene with you, they may spend 1 Ultima Point to reveal your true identity through sheer coincidence or superior intuition.</span></p>",
          "passive_name": "HUNDRED FACES",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "quirk"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Once before the next rest, you may perform an additional action on your turn during<br>a conflict scene. This action </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">must </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">be used to perform the </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Equipment</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Hinder</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, or<br></span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Inventory </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">action</span> </p>",
          "passive_name": "Sleep Soundly",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "camp activity"
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "passive_description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">You spend your time looking for useful items; describe how, then roll </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">1d6</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">.<br></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\"> </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">1. Ouch! </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">You recover </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">half </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">the normal amount of HP and MP during this rest.<br></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\"> </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2. Not what I was looking for... </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The target regains </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">2 Inventory Points</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">.<br></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\"> </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">3-5. Hoho, this can be useful! </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The target regains </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">3 Inventory Points</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">.<br></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\"> </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">6. Jackpot! </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The target regains </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">3 Inventory Points</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, and you also find an amount of<br>zenit equal to</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">your character’s level × 50</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">】</span> </p>",
          "passive_name": "Exploration",
          "passive_roll": "",
          "passive_source": "camp activity"
        }
      },
