      "skill_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Illusionist",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">After any of your Phantasms is shattered, you recover </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">7</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">MP.</span> </p>",
          "level": "5",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "PHANTASMAL ECHO"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Illusionist",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">When you cast a spell, if you don't have enough MP to pay for its total cost, you may choose to shatter one of your Phantasms instead.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"> Destroying a Phantasm this way will not trigger the Phantasmal Echo skill. </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">You cannot use this skill to create a Phantasm</span> </p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "PHANTASMAL RECYCLING"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Elementalist",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">When you cast an </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">instantaneous </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">spell, if you have an </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">arcane </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">weapon equipped, you may </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">increase the spell's total MP cost </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">by up to</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">SL × 10</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Mind Points. </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">If you do so and the spell deals damage to one or more creatures, it will deal 5 extra damage to each creature for every 10 Mind Points by which you increased its total MP cost</span> </p>",
          "level": "3",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "CATACLYSM"
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Chimerist",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">When you see a creature belonging to the </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">beast</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">, </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">monster </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">or </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">plant </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Species cast a spell, you may immediately choose to learn that spell as a Chimerist spell of your own: if you do, record the </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Species </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">of the creature you learned it from.</span> </p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">When you first acquire this Skill, choose<span class=\"fontstyle2\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">INS + WLP</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">or</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">MIG + WLP</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">】</span>. From now on, your offensive (<span class=\"fontstyle4\">r</span>) Chimerist spells will use the chosen Attributes for the Magic Check, regardless of the Attributes used by the creature you learned the spell from. <br></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">You may have <span class=\"fontstyle2\">up to</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">SL + 2</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">different Chimerist spells </span>memorized this way. If you want to memorize a new Chimerist spell but are already at your limit, you must forget one of your old spells and replace it with the new spell <br></span></p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "SPELL MIMIC"
        },
        "4": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Arcanist",
          "description": "<p><strong>MERGE : SPEARS OF THE ARDENT SOVEREIGN</strong><br>You have <strong>Resistance</strong> to <strong>fire</strong> damage.</p>\n<p>Additionally, as long as you are <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>not in Crisis</strong></span>, you also have <strong>Resistance</strong> to <strong>physical</strong> damage.</p>\n<p>All damage you deal becomes <strong>fire</strong>, its type <strong>cannot change</strong>, and it <strong>ignores Resistances</strong>; as long as <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>you are in Crisis</strong></span>, it also <strong>ignores Immunities</strong>.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>When you deal damage with a spell, if that spell deals damage to <strong>only one creature</strong>, it deals <strong>10 extra damage</strong>.</p>\n<p><br><strong>DISMISS : FORGOTTEN RADIANCE</strong><br>You deal <strong>20 fire damage </strong>to every enemy present on the scene, or <strong>30 fire damage</strong> if you are in <strong>Crisis</strong>; this damage <strong>ignores Resistances and &nbsp;Immunities </strong>.</p>\n<p>Then, you and every ally present on the scene regain <strong>2 Inventory Points</strong> for every enemy reduced to 0 Hit Points by this damage.</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "SUMMON : OPOCHLI THE OLD SUN GOD"
        },
        "5": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Arcanist",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">You may </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">bind </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Arcana to your soul and </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">summon </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">them later. When you encounter a new Arcanum, the Game Master will reveal what you must do in order to bind them.<br>You may use an action and spend 30 Mind Points to </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">summon </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">the power of one of the Arcana you have previously bound.<br>If you take this Skill at character creation, you begin play with one Arcanum bound to you (you may </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">choose it </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">from the sample Arcana or </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">create it </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">with your group). </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Any further Arcana must be obtained through exploration and story progression</span> </p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "BIND AND SUMMON"
        },
        "6": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Illusionist",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">You may perform Rituals whose effects fall within the </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">Illusionism<br></span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">discipline. Illusionism Rituals use </span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">INS + WLP</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">for the Magic Check</span> </p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "RITUAL ILLUSIONISM"
        },
        "7": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Illusionist",
          "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Each time you acquire this Skill, learn one Illusionist spell. Offensive (</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">o</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">)<br></span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">Illusionist </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">spells and Phantasm use </span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">【</span><span class=\"fontstyle3\">INS + WLP</span><span class=\"fontstyle4\">】 </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">for their Checks</span> </p>",
          "level": "3",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "ILLUSIONIST MAGIC"
        }
      },
